# Local PoC working dirs (created by `dpubnkctl init`)
# Each PoC repo has its own .gitignore for keys/JWT/FAR.

# Agent-sandbox-persistent PoC repos. Living inside /workspace lets the
# Docker Desktop bind mount survive container restarts; .gitignore keeps
# them out of dpubnkctl's git history. Operator can still version them
# separately under /workspace/lab/<name>/ if needed.
/lab/

# Agent scratch — per-clone, not shared.
CLAUDE.md
